/* ===== RELIGIOUS STUDIES · KHMER (faith pack, July 2026) =====
   PRIMARILY FOR KHMER PEOPLE (Cambodia) to learn about Jesus — Khmer is the
   primary language everywhere (titles, story text, explanations), with English
   the quiet second line. Mirrors faith/ne.js: the same two stories, the same
   10+10 big-moment sections, the same shared scene art. Deliberately Christian
   (the secular-content rule does NOT apply in faith mode). Content register:
   rich storytelling for the un-churched reader — every person, place and
   church-word introduced in-story on first use (Adam & Eve, Eden, Noah,
   Abraham, sacrifice, the prophets, exile, disciples, Mary Magdalene).
   Paraphrase only — no Bible-translation text is copied; references name the
   passages retold.
   Vocabulary (checked against Khmer Bible usage): ព្រះជាម្ចាស់ (God),
   ព្រះអង្គ (he, of God), ព្រះយេស៊ូ (Jesus), ទ្រង់ (he, of Jesus), បាប (sin),
   ជឿ / ជំនឿ (believe / faith), សេចក្តីស្រឡាញ់ (love), សង្គ្រោះ (save),
   ព្រះអង្គសង្គ្រោះ (Rescuer), ដំណឹងល្អ (gospel), ឈើឆ្កាង (cross),
   ព្រះវិញ្ញាណបរិសុទ្ធ (Holy Spirit), ការសន្យា (promise), សម្ពន្ធមេត្រី
   (covenant), ការប្រកបគ្នា (fellowship), ព្យាការី (prophet), សិស្ស
   (disciple), យញ្ញបូជា (sacrifice), និរទេស (exile), អាណាចក្រ (kingdom),
   ស្ថានសួគ៌ (heaven), ព្រះវិហារ (temple), ពិធីជ្រមុជទឹក (baptism),
   អធិស្ឋាន (pray).
   Register: royal/honorific verbs for God and Jesus as in Khmer church usage
   — មានព្រះបន្ទូល (said), ប្រទាន (gave), យាងមក (came), គង់នៅ (dwells),
   សុគត (died), មានព្រះជន្មរស់ឡើងវិញ (rose). Romanization follows the Khmer
   course scheme in lang/km.js (ASCII only; aspirates kh chh th ph; ng, nh;
   words romanized as pronounced). Native strings must avoid the chars
   ' " < > \ (they ride inline onclick handlers — use dashes for
   speech and ។ for sentence ends).
   IMPORTANT: keep paras[i][0] AND note[0] byte-stable once audio exists —
   clips in audio-kmf/ are hashed from these exact strings. Regenerate with
     osascript -l JavaScript extract_audio_strings.js kmf
     python3 generate_audio.py --lang kmf
   Scene art is shared with the Nepali pack (language-independent scene
   emblems — scenes and symbols only, no depictions of God or of Jesus'
   face). */
